### Overall Assessment
A competent integration test design delivered through an effectively menacing Malvo lens. The response demonstrates genuine understanding of microservice testing challenges (sagas, idempotency, compensating transactions) while maintaining character throughout. The main weakness is the gap between the conceptual framework and production-ready implementation - several critical helper functions remain undefined, and some scenarios (notification failures, complex async choreography) receive superficial treatment.
